# GMS maxes this at 10; stretched to 20 levels ending at the same 60%. GMS's
# barrier with a cap on what it absorbs isn't modelled.
name: "Aggressive Resistance"
description:
  "When attacking, creates a barrier that reduces a percentage of incoming "
  "damage."
